1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,583
[Shreesha] Meet Auditly. It keeps public money honest.

2
00:00:03,833 --> 00:00:09,000
[Shreesha] After a contract is signed, costs go up and new companies quietly join.

3
00:00:09,167 --> 00:00:11,500
[Shreesha] And no one checks the proof.

4
00:00:11,917 --> 00:00:17,750
[Shreesha] Officials lose track of what changed. Small firms can't find work that fits them.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,333
[Shreesha] Auditly fixes both, using four smart AI tools.

6
00:00:22,667 --> 00:00:29,417
[Shreesha] It reads public contract records, spots changes, finds matching jobs, and shows it all in one place.

7
00:00:29,667 --> 00:00:32,250
[Pranav] Tool one: Change Detector.

8
00:00:32,417 --> 00:00:36,333
[Pranav] It compares the signed contract with what really happened.

9
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:39,000
[Pranav] Here, it found five changes.

10
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:41,500
[Pranav] Tool two: Evidence Linker.

11
00:00:41,583 --> 00:00:44,750
[Pranav] It looks for the proof behind each change.

12
00:00:44,833 --> 00:00:48,583
[Pranav] No proof was found, so this change is flagged.

13
00:00:48,917 --> 00:00:53,583
[Pranav] Tool three gives each contract a score, showing where to look first.

14
00:00:53,750 --> 00:00:57,333
[Pranav] And it explains why, in simple words.

15
00:00:57,583 --> 00:01:01,833
[Jnandeep] It also connects the people and companies behind each contract.

16
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,250
[Jnandeep] Here, the same person runs both companies.

17
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:08,083
[Jnandeep] Officials get a clear dashboard,

18
00:01:08,333 --> 00:01:10,833
[Jnandeep] a list of what to check first,

19
00:01:11,083 --> 00:01:13,667
[Jnandeep] the full story of every contract,

20
00:01:13,833 --> 00:01:15,917
[Jnandeep] and alerts for every change.

21
00:01:16,250 --> 00:01:19,000
[Jnandeep] Tool four helps contractors find work.

22
00:01:19,167 --> 00:01:23,167
[Jnandeep] It matches each company to the jobs it can win,

23
00:01:23,583 --> 00:01:26,333
[Jnandeep] and shows how to fix what's missing.

24
00:01:26,667 --> 00:01:28,833
[Akash] Companies see their best matches,

25
00:01:29,083 --> 00:01:31,250
[Akash] a ranked list of jobs,

26
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:33,667
[Akash] what each job needs,

27
00:01:33,833 --> 00:01:35,750
[Akash] and their own profile.

28
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:38,917
[Akash] It's built for officials and businesses alike.

29
00:01:39,083 --> 00:01:41,250
[Akash] Governments pay to use it,

30
00:01:41,417 --> 00:01:43,667
[Akash] and companies search for free.

31
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:49,833
[Akash] We start with finding changes, then scores, then job matching, then a real state trial.

32
00:01:50,167 --> 00:01:54,500
[Akash] It's built with trusted, open tools.

33
00:01:55,500 --> 00:01:57,833
[Akash] Follow every rupee of public money.

34
00:01:58,167 --> 00:01:59,833
[All] We are Team Auditly.
